    metaDesc: 'Samsung French-door ice makers commonly frost over and quit. Here\'s the real cause, the reset/defrost steps to try, and when it needs a technician.',
    intro: 'If you own a Samsung French-door refrigerator and the ice maker has slowed down or stopped, you\'re in very common company — the ice-maker compartment on many of these models frosts over and jams up. Before you assume the worst, there are a few things worth trying, and it helps to know what a tech actually replaces when a reset isn\'t enough.',
